{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Docteur Jack","Docteur Jack retrace le parcours de l’homme qui a inspiré le film La Cité de la joie, le docteur Jack Preger. Un homme au destin extraordinaire, un fermier Gallois qui décide à l’âge de 35 ans de devenir médecin. Après avoir soigné dans les camps de réfugiés au Bangladesh à la fin de la guerre civile, avoir œuvré quelques temps aux côtés de Mère Teresa, docteur Jack décide de sillonner les bidonvilles de Calcutta pour apporter des soins gratuits aux plus démunis. Il inventait un mouvement devenu depuis mondialement connu: la Street Medicine.",[4],"activism",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":30,"media":33,"synopsis":36,"production":37,"characters":41,"roles":42,"awards":50,"tags":3},"Film","FR2017_171","fr2017-171-docteur-jack",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2017-11-08",2017,"Documentary",[17,25],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Pierre-Antoine Hiroz","pierre-antoine-hiroz",1961,0,"Male identifying","Switzerland",[],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":29},"Benoît Lange","benoit-lange",1965,[],[31,32],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":34,"trailerUrl":35},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/198/201/182726/format_page/docteur-jack.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cx37Rl-8ebU",{"native":2,"english":10},[38],{"country":39,"share":40},"France","Majority coproducer",[],[43,47],{"person":44,"role":46},{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":45},[],"Director of the film",{"person":48,"role":46},{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":49},[],[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
